d":"044b8759-f189-4147-841b-940e478d9ecb","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"まぁひとまず付けて書いておきます、手元で試してないけど・・・","ts":"1634873517.068400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J3o3j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f66906f3-95b9-467c-8161-c12bde312051","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"!無くてもいいかも","ts":"1634873378.068100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w1p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"86ddb6b1-6e68-4612-a1cb-702a54e80c1f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"packloadallの!、packaddのと意味が違った","ts":"1634873345.067700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=5G9A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"14f71d98-fd74-4766-9b5b-f6caf278f3ef","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"書いておきます","ts":"1634873279.067100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U8/I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e4849a1-a553-4f1d-a3fc-aa067cb69404","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"回答する時間無いので誰か頼んだ(他力本願)","ts":"1634873254.066900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y/g+"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                *:packl* *:packloadall*\n:packl[oadall][!]       'packpath' 以下の \"start\" ディレクトリ中の全パッケージ\n                        を読み込む。\n \n                        最初に、見つかったディレクトリが全て 'runtimepath' に\n                        追加され、次にそのディレクトリ内で見つかったプラグイン\n                        が読み込まれる。これにより、あるプラグインが別のプラグ\n                        インの何か、例えば \"autoload\" ディレクトリに依存するこ\n                        とが許可される。これがどのように役立つかは\n                        |packload-two-steps| を参照。\n \n                        これは通常起動時に.vimrcが読み込まれた後に自動的に行わ\n                        れる。このコマンドはそれよりも前に行うことができる。\n \n                        パッケージの読み込みは一度だけ行われる。`:packloadall`\n                        を再度使用しても効果はない。任意の ! が付けられた場合\n                        はすでに読み込みが行われていてもパッケージを読み込む。\n \n                        Note |vimrc| ファイル内に `:packloadall` が使われてい\n                        る場合、'runtimepath' オプションが更新され、後で\n                        'runtimepath' 内のすべてのプラグインが読み込まれる。こ\n                        れはそれらが再び読み込まれることを意味する。プラグイン\n                        はそれを正しく扱うことが期待される。\n \n                        (スクリプトを読み込む際の)エラーは読み込んでいるスクリ\n                        プトの読み込みのみを中止させる。その他のプラグインは読\n                        み込まれる。\n                        |packages|を参照。\n                        {|+eval| 機能付きでコンパイルされたときのみ有効}\n```","ts":"1634873220.066200","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"12734718-6bcb-4bae-9a3a-f31bc40ea507","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":h packloadall","ts":"1634873219.066100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"97kz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"edeee48f-efcc-4cc9-9ec6-5fd44c544b15","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"packの処理はvimrcが完全に読まれた後に行われるので、rtpの追加だけ先にするやつ","ts":"1634873212.065800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D3Jp5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5801975-1299-4898-9c57-3e80be263207","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"それ知らなかった・・・","ts":"1634873172.064900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jsW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e221fd17-4ff6-45a0-9c12-ae6216f672c4","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"packloadall!をplug#beginの前に書く必要がありますね","ts":"1634873153.064700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZGZqK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ee8f2f0-800e-4be4-b3ed