atail","title_link":"https://teratail.com/questions/365652?rss=all","text":"お世話になります。 vim8でエラーなくプラグインを読み込んだ上で開きたいです。使っているプラグインマネージャーはvim-plugです。エラーコードは以下の通りなのですが、これのままvimを開くとプラグインを読み込んでいない状態で開かれ、vim-plugの:PlugInstallなどのコマンドも動","thumb_url":"https://teratail.com/img/imgFacebookShare.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"teratail[テラテイル]","service_icon":"https://teratail.com/img/favicon/apple-touch-icon-72x72-precomposed.png","thumb_width":1200,"thumb_height":630,"from_url":"https://teratail.com/questions/365652?rss=all","original_url":"https://teratail.com/questions/365652?rss=all"},{"fallback":"GitHub: GitHub - preservim/nerdtree: A tree explorer plugin for vim.","id":2,"title":"GitHub - preservim/nerdtree: A tree explorer plugin for vim.","title_link":"https://github.com/preservim/nerdtree.git","text":"A tree explorer plugin for vim. Contribute to preservim/nerdtree development by creating an account on GitHub.","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/7222a685418a71c3d9168a60ef883036882641a8a07b490eb8427664c50efea7/preservim/nerdtree","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/preservim/nerdtree.git","original_url":"https://github.com/preservim/nerdtree.git"}],"edited":{"user":"BPV6T0C1J","ts":"1634872843.000000"},"subtype":"bot_message","bot_id":"BPV6T0C1J","username":"[Vim]の新着質問一覧｜teratail（テラテイル）","icons":{"image_48":"https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/slack-files2/bot_icons/2019-10-29/814941997319_48.png"},"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"c0a5a3df-ca34-458f-800a-04e747b39a4a","type":"message","user":"U02HUAWRM2T","text":"皆様のご返事ありがとうございます。\ng:vimrc_abc ような変数をつかえばいいということですか。\n試みてみます。","ts":"1634871048.061800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RZ082"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a79df100-aec9-441c-aa61-c77efa838bc0","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0